<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Settlement Payment Completed</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f5f7; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; }
    .header { background-color: #0d904f; padding: 24px 32px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #ffffff; font-size: 20px; margin: 12px 0 0; font-weight: 600; }
    .body { padding: 32px; color: #333333; line-height: 1.6; }
    .info-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 16px 0; }
    .info-table td { padding: 8px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e8eaed; font-size: 14px; }
    .info-table td:first-child { color: #666666; width: 40%; }
    .info-table td:last-child { font-weight: 600; }
    .success-badge { background-color: #e8f5e9; color: #2e7d32; text-align: center; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; }
    .amount { font-size: 24px; color: #0d904f; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; padding: 16px; background-color: #e8f5e9; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0; }
    .footer { background-color: #f4f5f7; padding: 24px 32px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #999999; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <div style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700;">Meal Ticket</div>
      <h1>Settlement Payment Completed</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Dear <strong>{{recipientName}}</strong>,</p>

      <div class="success-badge">Settlement payment has been completed successfully</div>

      <p>Payment transaction details:</p>

      <table class="info-table">
        <tr>
          <td>Settlement ID</td>
          <td>{{settlementId}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Settlement Period</td>
          <td>{{periodStart}} ~ {{periodEnd}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Payment Date</td>
          <td>{{paidDate}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Payment Method</td>
          <td>{{paymentMethod}}</td>
        </tr>
        {{#if bankAccount}}
        <tr>
          <td>Bank Account</td>
          <td>{{bankAccount}}</td>
        </tr>
        {{/if}}
      </table>

      <div class="amount">{{totalAmount}}</div>

      {{#if transactionRef}}
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666666;">Transaction Reference: <strong>{{transactionRef}}</strong></p>
      {{/if}}

      <p>If you have any questions about this transaction, please do not hesitate to contact us.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>Meal Ticket Platform &mdash; Corporate Meal Management Solution</p>
      <p>This is an automated email. Please do not reply directly.</p>
      <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} Meal Ticket Vietnam Co., Ltd. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
